%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '16px', 'fontFamily': 'arial'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Agent
    participant Output

    User->>Orch: Start workflow

    loop Each agent
        Orch->>Agent: Initialize
        Agent->>Output: Generate artifact
        Output->>User: Present for review

        alt Approved
            User->>Orch: Continue
        else Feedback
            User->>Agent: Revise
        end
    end

    Orch->>User: Complete
